    "28": {
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "edition": "Monday 26 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection plan",
          "heading": "Jake White says Fiji can be a massive force at 2027 World Cup",
          "body": "Jake White wants his best players back for the 2027 World Cup, and Fiji's Europe-based contingent should be available for the November Tests. White, the 2007 World Cup-winning Springbok coach, picked no Europe-based players against Japan and handed out four new caps, saying he wants to get \"the best 33 players together\" for the tournament in Australia. The three Nations Championship games in Europe, against France, Ireland and Italy, will be the first real test of that plan."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Australia A beat USA 61-12 despite Feliuai red card",
          "body": "Marchant back in England camp; Atkinson rehabbing knee. Montoya returns as Los Pumas captain; Ruiz and Oviedo injured. France's Ward in 42-man squad but misses November Tests."
