    "386": {
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "edition": "Monday 26 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad call-up",
          "heading": "Joe Marchant back in England camp while Seb Atkinson rehabs knee",
          "body": "Joe Marchant is back in England colours after being named in Steve Borthwick's 36-player training camp for the autumn Nations Championship matches. The 30-year-old centre has not played for England since the 2023 World Cup, becoming ineligible after joining Stade Français, but he is available again after returning to Sale Sharks. Borthwick faces injury disruption in midfield, with Seb Atkinson limited to knee rehabilitation at the camp. Marchant, with 26 caps, said in September: \"I want to play for England, that's what I want to do.\""
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Australia A beat USA 61-12 despite Feliuai red card",
          "body": "Montoya returns as Los Pumas captain; Ruiz and Oviedo injured. France's Ward in 42-man squad but misses November Tests."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "name": "BBC Rugby Union"
      }
