          "kicker": "Log position",
          "heading": "Italy sit 11th of 12 in the log after three straight defeats",
          "body": "Italy go into the South Africa match 11th of 12 in the log, having lost all three games so far. Those three have produced 37 points scored and 131 conceded, a points difference of -94. The last of them was a 10-57 defeat to Australia in Round three. Italy's best-ever world ranking is No. 8, reached in 2007 and 2024."
