          "kicker": "Call-up watch",
          "heading": "Two Scotland hopefuls earn call-ups from Glasgow's 24-20 Benetton win",
          "body": "Glasgow's 24-20 win in Treviso produced two Scotland hopefuls who have earned call-ups, the Scotsman reports. Jamie Ritchie's 80-minute blindside display, in his first Warriors appearance after eight months of ankle and Achilles trouble, was the eye-catching part. Gregor Townsend was due to make his postponed Nations Championship squad announcement on Monday. The 63-cap former captain is the one to watch as that squad takes shape."
