      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury worry",
          "heading": "Rio Dyer and Ben Carter injured in Dragons derby loss to Ospreys",
          "body": "Wales wing Rio Dyer and second-row Ben Carter both left the Dragons' derby defeat to the Ospreys injured, and the extent of Dyer's problem is not yet clear. Dyer went off before half-time and Carter was forced out early in the second half with a head injury. Head coach Filo Tiatia called the knee-drop tackle that left centre Fetuli Paea limping off \"dangerous\", and pointed to three yellow cards for indiscipline. Knee-drop tackles are banned throughout rugby from 1 November."
        },
