        {
          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Contepomi names Montoya back as captain in 33-man London camp squad",
          "body": "Julián Montoya is back to captain Los Pumas after missing the home tests against South Africa and Australia, and Felipe Contepomi has named a 33-man squad for the London camp that Americas Rugby News calls his strongest of the year. Marcos Kremer, Justo Piccardo, Mateo Carreras and Bautista Delguy are all in. Hooker Ignacio Ruiz and No. 8 Joaquín Oviedo are out injured. Contepomi confirms the November roster once the three-day camp ends."
        },
